"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n\n## Review\nIt was peak dinner hour and every restaurant nearby had a massive line.  \nWe wandered around hungry for a while before finding a ramen place with decent reviews and no wait.\n\nI was craving something spicy, so I ordered the Spicy Tonkotsu Ramen and the karaage chicken rice bowl.\n\n\n\nThe ramen was decent — nothing extraordinary.  \nIt wasn't particularly memorable, but just being able to walk in without waiting during peak hour was more than enough.\n\nThe rice bowl sauce was actually spot-on for my taste, so I ended up enjoying the bowl even more.  \nThe rice bowl left a stronger impression than the ramen.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n"